/target
**/target
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exp
*.lib
*.obj

# Compiled rule databases are build artefacts, not sources — except the one the
# release ships. The rule sources themselves are not distributed here; see the
# Licensing section of the README, and `rules/.gitkeep` for where they would go.
*.avdb
!assets/rules.avdb

# A vendored `libclang` 17 for the driver's bindgen, which does not understand
# the installed LLVM 22. 103 MB of somebody else's DLL, fetched by the command
# in `crates/av-driver/.libclang/README`. It is not deleted and not checked in:
# the driver build needs it, and it is not source.
crates/av-driver/.libclang/

# An installed layout from an old build. Not source, and not the directory a
# running installation uses. See the Build section of the README.
/dist/

# `tools/` keeps the sources and scripts of the diagnostic tools. The binaries
# built from them are not sources. (`*.pdb` above already covers their symbols.)
/tools/*.exe

# Local runtime state
/data/quarantine
/data/logs
/data/cache
/data/config.toml
